  "bio": "Experience the exceptional artistry at Hammer's Tattoo & Body Piercing, Canton's premier destination for black & gray ink aficionados and Stark County's longest-operating studio. Voted The Repository Reader's Choice Favorite Tattoo Shop from 2013-18, our studio prides itself on delivering exquisite designs in a welcoming, professional environment where creativity meets precision. Join us to add timeless elegance to your skin’s canvas.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Canton, Ohio, United States"
